cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Madrid Flat Price Estimator (webscraping-fotocasa)"
abstract: >-
  Scrapes property listings from Fotocasa, builds a cleaned dataset, trains and
  evaluates price-prediction models for flats in Madrid, and ships a static
  browser estimator and an LLM agent. Master's thesis project.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/mmartinsie/webscraping-fotocasa"
